# Writer boundary of the atom counter. Format: path|function|families|reason
# families: T tip (mk:) · C conflict/history rows · B atom body · N atom counter · M molecule header counters and the bindings counter · R blob counter and blob queue · - none of these
# One line for each function that the lint finds. The lint fails on a function that is missing,
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/atom_history/policy.rs|set_field_history_policy|C|writes only a canonical field policy and the logical format fence in one native transaction; no tip, archive, atom, or reference counter write
# on a function that names a family the line does not list, and on a line that no function matches.
# `*` as the function is for the planner module only.

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/metadata_store/idempotency.rs|retire_legacy|-|bounded cleanup inside the reserved idempotency namespace; deletes only validated legacy idem keys and writes its cleanup marker in the native request snapshot; no tip, atom or counter keys

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/delete_replay.rs|prune_delete_barriers|-|explicit stopped-home maintenance: durably publish the replay floor and older-reader refusal before any Delete barrier can leave; never modifies a tip, atom or reference counter
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/delete_replay.rs|prune_delete_scope|-|explicit stopped-home maintenance removes only identity-checked Delete barriers at or before the durable replay floor; no planner-owned record changes

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/recount/molecules/apply.rs|apply_molecule_recount|M|explicit offline recount on a stopped, exclusively locked home; validates every source family before whole-batch molecule repair and drain rearm
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/recount/molecules/apply.rs|plan_header|M|offline molecule repair preserves readable header metadata and replaces only exact slots/records counts after a complete tally
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/recount/molecules/apply.rs|plan_bindings|M|offline molecule repair reconstructs the bindings counter from validated binding records; no tip, atom or conflict writes

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/build.rs|*|T C B N|the planner: the only writer of tips, bodies, counters and conflict references inside a write scope
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/commit.rs|*|T C B N M|the planner: its one batch_mutate joins the pending batch of the request; the molecule counters in the header rows of the batch come from counter/molecule.rs
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/blob_counter/commit.rs|*|R|the blob planner: blob counters and queue entries change in the batch of the atom counters (counter/build.rs), or in the request scope of a blob row put
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/blob_counter/dwell_chunk.rs|*|R|the dwell chunk: reads the counter again in the write gate, then deletes the blob row, the counter and the queue entry in one batch (the retirement of a bucket is the guarded delete of the planner)
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/blob_counter/recount.rs|*|R|the blob step of the offline recount: writes the exact blob counters and deletes stale queue entries on a stopped home, in whole batches
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/molecule_bindings.rs|flip_molecule_bindings|M|the one writer of binding records and of the bindings counter: both change in one batch inside the write gate, from the state of the records

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/recount/apply.rs|plan_decision|B N|offline recount (`lastdb db recount` on a stopped home, the one scan the design keeps): writes the exact counter, deletes a counter that has no body, and deletes a body that no tip and no counted record names; no gate and no writer exist while it runs; only the offline command calls it
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/recount/apply.rs|flush_pending|-|offline recount: writes the batch that plan_decision built; the batch is whole, and a second run changes only what is still wrong

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/admin_db/history_prune.rs|clear_mutation_history|C|clear-history deletes history rows that are not conflict rows (a conflict row keeps its atom references)


fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/admin_db/orphan_proteins.rs|gc_orphan_proteins_in_scope|-|empty protein rows





fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/keep_small.rs|clear_keep_small_distrust_marker|-|keep-small meter distrust marker
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/keep_small.rs|note_keep_small_hydrate_failure|-|keep-small meter distrust marker



fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/molecules/generation/activate.rs|reclaim_expired_generations|T|immutable generation slot rows (mgr, mgp); the live mirror tips go through the planner in the same request; a slot row holds no count
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/molecules/generation/activate.rs|write_generation_bodies|T|immutable generation slot rows (mgr, mgp); the live mirror tips go through the planner in the same request; a slot row holds no count

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/conflict_index_heal.rs|prune_conflict_index|C|rewrites the mcc: id list inside a write scope; the list holds no atom reference
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/conflict_index_heal.rs|stamp_conflict_index|C|rewrites the mcc: id list inside a write scope; the list holds no atom reference

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/conflict_operations/home_index.rs|delete_event_keys|C|hcu: home conflict events and stamp; they hold no atom reference
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/conflict_operations/home_index.rs|write_home_conflict_stamp|C|hcu: home conflict events and stamp; they hold no atom reference


# db_catalog_store.rs::drop_scoped_source_rows deletes every row of one scope through a store argument (tips, bodies and counters go together). The lint cannot see keys that a caller hands to it.




fold_db/crates/core/src/storage/encrypting_store/kv_store_impl.rs|restore_batch_put|T C B N|store layer: passes a restored row to the inner store


fold_db/crates/core/src/storage/traits/kv.rs|restore_batch_put|T C B N|store trait: default restore of one row


































lastdb_node/src/bin/received_range_seed.rs|activate_generated_receivers|-|CI-only generated share_subscriptions controls in an isolated owned home; mutation manager owns all tip, atom, and counter writes




fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/erase_meters.rs|record_atom_delete_audit|-|final dellog audit facts only, optionally database-prefixed; staged in the same native batch as the erase, with no atom, tip, or counter keys
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/atom_store/counter/restore_validation.rs|finish|-|exclusive restore completion deletes only its durable pending marker after exact read-only counter verification

fold_db/crates/core/src/alternate_keys/write.rs|stage_alternate_changes|-|writes only ak: typed primary-key references inside the native request; creates no atom, field tip, history or reference counter
fold_db/crates/core/src/fold_db_core/fold_db/alternate_key_changes/finish.rs|cleanup|-|deletes bounded ak: pages only for an unbound retired generation or this change's unpublished generation; receipt cleanup uses alternate_changes; atom and field-tip lifecycle stays in the existing planner
